   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Support to the EBRD Crisis Response Special Fund Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the programme - a contribution to the EBRD Crisis Response Special Fund - is to support resilience through the support for early recovery and later reconstruction with the ultimate goal of preserving and improving the livelihoods of people in Mykolaiv and wider Ukraine.</narrative>
