  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EBRD loan complemented by the investment grant will support the uninterrupted provision of essential and affordable public transport services, facilitate the mobility of most vulnerable groups of population and improve the accessibility of the City&#x2019;s public transport for disabled people, whose needs are poorly satisfied with the existing coverage and the City&#x2019;s existing outdated fleet.</narrative>
   </title>
